<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Optional practice support</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/b/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper B</p><h1>Optional practice support</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper B</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>This optional preparation list is not part of the timed paper. Using it during an attempt changes the support condition.</p><table><tr><th>Chinese</th><th>Pinyin</th><th>Meaning</th></tr><tr><td class="cn">备用钥匙</td><td>bèiyòng yàoshi</td><td>spare key</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">猫粮</td><td>māoliáng</td><td>cat food</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">梳毛</td><td>shū máo</td><td>brush fur</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">羽毛球</td><td>yǔmáoqiú</td><td>badminton</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">球拍</td><td>qiúpāi</td><td>racket</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">车篮</td><td>chēlán</td><td>bicycle basket</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">广场</td><td>guǎngchǎng</td><td>square</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">换车</td><td>huàn chē</td><td>transfer vehicles</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">野餐垫</td><td>yěcān diàn</td><td>picnic mat</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">押金</td><td>yājīn</td><td>refundable deposit</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">冷藏</td><td>lěngcáng</td><td>keep refrigerated</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">香包</td><td>xiāngbāo</td><td>sachet</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">盖章</td><td>gài zhāng</td><td>stamp</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">返校</td><td>fǎn xiào</td><td>return to school</td></tr></table></section></main></body></html>